{"file":"watch-video-1.0.0-v2.zip","bytes":626780,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"watch-video","description":"Make Claude watch any video. Local file, public URL (yt-dlp), or Jira attachment (fully automated). Extracts keyframes with ffmpeg, transcribes with local faster-whisper or hosted Groq/OpenAI Whisper, and produces a paste-ready evidence-bundle Markdown report.","version":"1.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/MarcinSufa/claude-watch-video","homepage":"https://github.com/MarcinSufa/claude-watch-video","keywords":["video","transcription","whisper","ffmpeg","jira","bug-repro","screen-recording","yt-dlp","multimodal"]}],"skills":[{"path":"SKILL.md","name":"watch-video","description":"Make Claude \"watch\" a video — local file, public URL (yt-dlp), or Jira attachment (fully automated when an Atlassian API token is configured). Extracts keyframes with ffmpeg and transcribes audio with faster-whisper (multilingual), then Claude reads frames + transcript to answer the user's question. Use when the user wants to analyze a screen recording, bug repro video, demo capture, or any video they point at. Triggers - \"watch this video\", \"analyze this video\", \"what happens in <file>.mp4\", \"transcribe and watch\", \"process this bug repro\", a Jira ticket key followed by \"watch the video\", a YouTube/Loom/TikTok/etc. URL with \"watch this\" or \"summarize this\".","headings":["/watch-video","Common mistakes — don't do these","Decide before invoking","Input modes","When to use","When NOT to use","How it works","Frame budget","Workspace","meta.json schema (v2)","report.md — evidence bundle","Prereqs (one-time)","Jira token setup","Step 1 — Create the token","Step 2 — Save credentials to disk","Step 3 — Verify","Security notes","How the skill uses it"],"name_hint":"watch · 视频","description_zh":"用ffmpeg关键帧和faster-whisper多语言转录分析本地视频、yt-dlp公开URL或配置Atlassian令牌的Jira附件，以帧及转录回答，适用于录屏、缺陷复现和演示。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"p